tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为联合瑞金医院发布瑞智病理大模型RuiPath 2.0并落地90余家医院</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成10万亿参数基座模型Bel预训练，性能超越Astra</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果硬件工程负责人约翰·特努斯将于9月1日正式接任CEO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4d5678ac2f49dc7af8547fe649d61094.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果硬件工程负责人约翰·特努斯将于9月1日正式接任CEO，现任CEO蒂姆·库克转任董事会执行主席。特努斯拥有25年硬件研发经验，其任期内首要任务是加速AI战略落地。苹果计划于9月全面推出新版Siri AI，并推进包括智能家居设备、具备环境感知能力的摄像头版AirPods及智能眼镜在内的AI硬件布局。此外，特努斯正推动AI技术渗透至内部研发、硬件测试及设备可靠性提升流程。9月9日苹果将举行新品发布会，这将是特努斯上任后的首次重大活动，外界预计首款折叠屏iPhone有望亮相。面对AI发展滞后、服务业务增长放缓及供应链成本上升等挑战，特努斯需利用硬件优势补齐AI能力短板，重塑苹果在AI时代的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">索尼与华纳正式起诉Anthropic，指控其非法利用版权音乐训练Claude模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">索尼与华纳近日正式向Anthropic提起诉讼，指控其在开发Claude系列AI模型过程中，未经授权大规模非法利用受版权保护的音乐作品进行训练。起诉书显示，Anthropic创始人及员工被指控通过BitTorrent及Pirate Library Mirror等渠道获取数百万本盗版图书，并绕过MusixMatch等合法授权平台，直接非法抓取歌词数据。原告方要求法院对每部侵权作品判处最高15万美元赔偿，并对恶意删除版权信息的行为额外追加最高2.5万美元赔偿。若法院裁定胜诉，Anthropic面临的赔偿总额可能高达数十亿美元。此案凸显了AI行业在追求模型参数规模与数据吞吐量时，训练数据合规性已成为决定企业商业命运的关键门槛，标志着内容版权方与AI企业在知识产权领域的博弈进一步升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为联合瑞金医院发布瑞智病理大模型RuiPath 2.0并落地90余家医院</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58499a5151259817f0c25518927e1502.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为近日联合上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院正式发布瑞智病理大模型RuiPath 2.0，该模型已在全国90余家医院投入临床应用。RuiPath 2.0在核心诊断能力上实现显著升级，重点强化了对常见癌症中隐蔽的少见及罕见亚型的识别能力，旨在解决传统病理诊断中易出现的漏诊与误诊痛点。研发团队目前正基于该版本，深入探索病理多模态生成式基础模型在淋巴瘤复杂临床诊断场景中的应用，致力于为医生提供更精准、高效的智能辅助决策工具。此次发布标志着医疗AI在病理诊断领域的进一步落地，通过技术手段提升复杂病理分析的准确性，为临床医疗提供更强有力的数字化支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成10万亿参数基座模型Bel预训练，性能超越Astra</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已完成代号为“Bel”的超大规模基座模型预训练，该模型参数量达10万亿级别，旨在突破AGI门槛。Bel在编码、推理及长时程Agent任务表现上均超越Astra，具备数天无人干预的持续运行能力、自我恢复机制，并能协调数百个并行子Agent。该模型深度结合自研芯片“Jalapeño”底层代码，通过递归自我改进机制优化基础设施，大幅降低运营成本。业内预计Bel有望在今年年底或Astra发布后数月内亮相。此次突破标志着OpenAI在世界模型理解深度及算力闭环上的重大进展，将加速从云端大规模Agent集群向个人AI秘书的演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
